+
+<dl><dt><a name="AndroidActionRunner-TurnScreenOff"><strong>TurnScreenOff</strong></a>(self)</dt><dd><tt>If&nbsp;device&nbsp;screen&nbsp;is&nbsp;on,&nbsp;turn&nbsp;screen&nbsp;off.<br>
