+
+<dl><dt><a name="AndroidActionRunner-UnlockScreen"><strong>UnlockScreen</strong></a>(self)</dt><dd><tt>If&nbsp;device&nbsp;screen&nbsp;is&nbsp;locked,&nbsp;unlocks&nbsp;it.<br>
