+element&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;page.&nbsp;A&nbsp;selector&nbsp;can&nbsp;also&nbsp;be&nbsp;'all'&nbsp;to&nbsp;play&nbsp;all&nbsp;media&nbsp;elements.<br>
