+    <p><tt>A&nbsp;server&nbsp;that&nbsp;serves&nbsp;MSR&nbsp;values&nbsp;over&nbsp;TCP.&nbsp;Takes&nbsp;a&nbsp;port&nbsp;as&nbsp;its&nbsp;sole&nbsp;parameter.<br>
